---
/* The graded reader, frozen mid-tap: one sentence opened to show its
   reading, the rest of the page going on around it. The gloss carries the
   same speaker the lesson player's lines do. */
---

<div class="mock" role="group" aria-label="Mockup of a graded short story">
  <div class="mock-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Short story</span>
    <span class="mock-aside">Level A1</span>
  </div>

  <h3 class="story-title">Un perro en la estación</h3>

  <p class="story-line">Ana camina a la estación cada mañana.</p>
  <p class="story-line">Hoy hace mucho frío.</p>

  <div class="story-tapped">
    <p class="story-tapped-line">Un perro pequeño la espera en la puerta.</p>
    <p class="story-gloss">
      <svg
        class="story-gloss-icon"
        width="15"
        height="15"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.8"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M4 9.5v5h2.8l4.2 3.2v-13L6.8 9.5H4z"></path>
        <path d="M14 9.8a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 0 4.4"></path>
        <path d="M16.8 7.6a7.2 7.2 0 0 1 0 8.8"></path>
      </svg>
      A small dog is waiting for her at the door.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="story-line">—¡Hola, amigo! —dice Ana, y abre su bolsa.</p>

  <div class="story-progress">
    <div class="meter"><div class="meter-fill" style="width: 33%"></div></div>
    <span class="story-progress-label tnum">2 / 6</span>
  </div>
</div>
